    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Evil Inside is a single player highly atmospheric Horror Adventure game inspired by a retro classic Haunted House, in a modern re-take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A top down perspective gives you a dark and atmospheric environment to navigate, and you must avoid a evil creatures that inhabit that area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant Spiders, Bats, Ghosts, Vampires, Werewolves, Demons, Chainsaw wielding maniacs are all out to stop you in your task to retrieve and rebuild 3 pieces of broken Relic-Stones, and return them to a portal to banish the creatures.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Spooky atmoshpere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top Down Survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location has a special &quot;Boss&quot; Monster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock extra levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingame Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Evil Inside is a single player highly atmospheric Horror Adventure game inspired by a retro classic Haunted House, in a modern re-take.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A top down perspective gives you a dark and atmospheric environment to navigate, and you must avoid a evil creatures that inhabit that area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Giant Spiders, Bats, Ghosts, Vampires, Werewolves, Demons, Chainsaw wielding maniacs are all out to stop you in your task to retrieve and rebuild 3 pieces of broken Relic-Stones, and return them to a portal to banish the creatures.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Spooky atmoshpere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top Down Survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location has a special &quot;Boss&quot; Monster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock extra levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ingame Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A single player Horror adventure, asks you to enter various haunted locations and face evil creatures. Using just your lantern, you will face peril in every room and around every corner to complete your task.",
